WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.870
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.140 --> 00:29.360
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.550 --> 00:32.940
[Episode 15]

4
01:08.920 --> 01:10.120
I never expected that

5
01:10.430 --> 01:13.890
you were the one who destroyed everything for my sister and me.

6
01:15.940 --> 01:17.410
Thousands of years later,

7
01:18.170 --> 01:21.030
you even want to destroy the very last memory of her.

8
01:21.980 --> 01:23.830
You truly deserve to die.

9
01:24.570 --> 01:25.990
What are you talking about?

10
01:25.990 --> 01:27.400
Have you forgotten

11
01:28.300 --> 01:30.160
the sins you committed yourself?

12
01:35.430 --> 01:36.840
Sister! Sister!

13
01:37.210 --> 01:39.000
I grew a new bud today!

14
01:39.729 --> 01:41.890
When do you think I'll grow up

15
01:41.920 --> 01:44.479
and become a Tree Spirit as beautiful as you?

16
01:45.320 --> 01:46.789
If you work hard at magic,

17
01:46.820 --> 01:48.350
you'll grow up much faster.

18
01:50.310 --> 01:51.479
Sister,

19
01:51.479 --> 01:53.479
have you finished weaving that yet?

20
01:53.710 --> 01:56.000
I told you to study, but you never did.

21
01:56.280 --> 01:57.920
But you know how to weave it,

22
01:57.920 --> 01:59.039
so I don't need to learn.

23
01:59.039 --> 02:00.300
Look. Isn't it pretty?

24
02:01.120 --> 02:02.120
Let me put it on you.

25
02:02.120 --> 02:02.710
Okay.

26
02:02.790 --> 02:03.390
Come here.

27
02:05.890 --> 02:06.930
So cute.

28
02:08.310 --> 02:10.169
The Tree Spirit is inside. Hurry!

29
02:22.840 --> 02:23.870
Sister.

30
02:25.800 --> 02:27.160
We are playing hide-and-seek now.

31
02:27.160 --> 02:28.110
Hide quickly.

32
02:28.210 --> 02:29.270
Don't make a sound.

33
02:51.790 --> 02:53.120
The Tree Spirit is here!

34
03:21.260 --> 03:22.100
Sister.

35
03:31.030 --> 03:31.870
Move.

36
04:11.600 --> 04:12.450
Move.

37
04:22.360 --> 04:23.630
I saw it.

38
04:24.730 --> 04:25.820
But I don't remember.

39
04:25.820 --> 04:26.950
You don't remember?

40
04:27.280 --> 04:28.520
Of course you don't.

41
04:29.090 --> 04:31.460
You were the one who took my sister to the palace,

42
04:31.460 --> 04:32.560
draining her blood day after day

43
04:32.560 --> 04:33.960
to feed that old Emperor!

44
04:36.080 --> 04:36.920
And now,

45
04:37.360 --> 04:38.870
you still dare to show up.

46
04:39.530 --> 04:41.860
You even dare to ruin their relationship!

47
04:42.310 --> 04:44.560
I'll grind your bones to ash!

48
04:44.680 --> 04:45.600
No!

49
04:48.990 --> 04:49.840
Xie He.

50
04:50.830 --> 04:51.870
Don't kill him.

51
04:56.800 --> 04:57.880
Song Yiqiu.

52
04:58.600 --> 05:00.390
You're saving him again?

53
05:01.150 --> 05:02.750
Have you forgotten who he is?

54
05:03.680 --> 05:05.740
He is the one you should hate the most!

55
05:06.360 --> 05:07.800
He's Lin Huai.

56
05:08.360 --> 05:10.070
Lin Huai has never harmed me.

57
05:10.190 --> 05:12.320
What on earth is wrong with you, Xie He?

58
05:12.360 --> 05:13.430
Fine.

59
05:14.070 --> 05:16.200
I'll make you see clearly for yourself

60
05:16.480 --> 05:19.560
just how ridiculous and pathetic you are!

61
05:29.050 --> 05:30.010
No.

62
05:36.230 --> 05:37.080
Lin Huai.

63
05:38.750 --> 05:39.750
Lin Huai.

64
05:44.290 --> 05:44.930
I...

65
05:46.110 --> 05:48.110
humbly beg to wed Princess Ningjia.

66
05:50.190 --> 05:50.830
I...

67
05:51.810 --> 05:53.810
humbly beg to wed Princess Ningjia.

68
05:55.870 --> 05:56.510
I...

69
05:57.440 --> 05:59.610
humbly beg to wed Princess Ningjia.

70
06:13.610 --> 06:15.830
That was my first time entering the palace to meet His Majesty.

71
06:15.830 --> 06:18.200
Before I left, my mother repeatedly reminded me

72
06:18.200 --> 06:19.440
to keep my eyes down.

73
06:20.170 --> 06:21.720
But I was always

74
06:21.750 --> 06:23.360
so curious about the palace.

75
06:24.640 --> 06:26.170
I couldn't help but look up.

76
06:26.750 --> 06:27.630
And then...

77
06:28.190 --> 06:29.480
I saw her.

78
06:32.840 --> 06:35.230
A bird trapped in a golden cage.

79
06:36.120 --> 06:39.040
It looked like she might jump from that height at any moment.

80
06:39.040 --> 06:40.159
Not to fall,

81
06:40.750 --> 06:42.040
but to fly.

82
06:43.510 --> 06:45.590
But the walls in this palace are so high.

83
06:45.590 --> 06:48.120
Those who wish to fly will die.

84
06:49.270 --> 06:49.930
Will she...

85
06:50.630 --> 06:51.680
die?

86
07:48.640 --> 07:50.100
Since you are still alive,

87
07:50.500 --> 07:51.940
let me help you fly.

88
07:59.870 --> 08:01.600
His Majesty has just taken his medicine.

89
08:01.600 --> 08:04.430
General, please rest in the Imperial Garden for a while.

90
08:04.430 --> 08:05.890
When His Majesty wakes up,

91
08:06.360 --> 08:08.600
you will be summoned to see him.

92
08:08.920 --> 08:09.560
Alright.

93
08:17.840 --> 08:19.310
This huge palace

94
08:20.630 --> 08:22.830
is filled with nothing but dull people.

95
08:51.520 --> 08:55.020
♪ Swallow goes south to the setting sun ♪

96
08:55.040 --> 08:57.510
♪ Smiling at late autumn's sudden warmth ♪

97
08:58.330 --> 09:01.940
♪ Through all the twists and turns, my heart still holds on ♪

98
09:01.970 --> 09:04.570
♪ Leaving only gentleness behind ♪

99
09:05.370 --> 09:11.860
♪ Through a thousand years of cold, my dreams are warmed by you ♪

100
09:12.560 --> 09:17.560
♪ Two inches of fleeting youth, memories I can never stop reliving ♪

101
09:12.720 --> 09:13.510
Greetings, Your Majesty.

102
09:13.510 --> 09:15.480
My dear general, you found the Tree Spirit for me,

103
09:15.480 --> 09:16.750
and made a great contribution.

104
09:16.750 --> 09:18.150
Among all the officials,

105
09:18.670 --> 09:20.030
only you

106
09:19.320 --> 09:21.900
♪ Frost touches my brows ♪

107
09:20.240 --> 09:22.080
know my worries.

108
09:21.930 --> 09:24.960
♪ I still wish for rain, even if I must hold the umbrella alone ♪

109
09:22.600 --> 09:24.320
Your Majesty is blessed with heavenly fortune.

110
09:24.320 --> 09:25.600
You are surely destined for a long life.

111
09:25.600 --> 09:26.440
Well said.

112
09:26.320 --> 09:32.320
♪ A thousand robes of fine silk, I never care to look closely ♪

113
09:27.550 --> 09:28.880
Whatever else you want,

114
09:29.120 --> 09:30.510
I will grant it to you.

115
09:31.840 --> 09:32.390
I...

116
09:33.080 --> 09:34.200
do have a request.

117
09:33.320 --> 09:36.580
♪ The simple pleasures of this world feel like an illusion ♪

118
09:35.390 --> 09:35.870
I

119
09:36.600 --> 09:39.230
♪ If you're not here ♪

120
09:37.270 --> 09:39.270
humbly beg to wed Princess Ningjia.

121
09:40.100 --> 09:45.330
♪ Don't blame me for having no worldly desires ♪

122
09:42.630 --> 09:43.630
Who is that?

123
09:45.750 --> 09:46.790
You Majesty, it's the princess

124
09:46.790 --> 09:48.790
you brought back from among the common folk years ago.

125
09:48.790 --> 09:50.720
She is now living in Duansi Palace.

126
09:53.150 --> 09:54.810
I admire the princess deeply.

127
09:55.650 --> 09:58.110
I humbly ask Your Majesty for your blessing.

128
09:59.150 --> 09:59.790
Very well.

129
10:00.060 --> 10:03.480
♪ Looking back from the shore of the river of time ♪

130
10:00.320 --> 10:01.520
You have my blessing.

131
10:02.600 --> 10:03.750
Thank you for your gracious blessing, Your Majesty.

132
10:03.510 --> 10:06.980
♪ The falling flowers are brighter than the fireworks ♪

133
10:04.200 --> 10:06.870
Princess Ningjia is gentle and intelligent.

134
10:06.870 --> 10:09.510
General Yu is second to none in loyalty and bravery.

135
10:07.010 --> 10:09.970
♪ A life, a promise, walking slowly along the shore ♪

136
10:09.510 --> 10:10.870
You two are a perfect match.

137
10:09.990 --> 10:13.850
♪ As if yesterday passed without regrets ♪

138
10:11.000 --> 10:12.480
I hereby grant them permission to marry,

139
10:12.480 --> 10:15.000
and they'll be wed on the auspicious eighth day of the third lunar month

140
10:13.870 --> 10:17.360
♪ I can smile upon the reunions and partings of the past ♪

141
10:15.000 --> 10:16.600
as a token of my special favor.

142
10:16.600 --> 10:17.200
General.

143
10:17.380 --> 10:20.750
♪ Yet forgetting you is far too hard ♪

144
10:17.720 --> 10:18.480
What is this?

145
10:19.270 --> 10:20.240
This is the bow I used when I was 15,

146
10:20.240 --> 10:22.300
when I first went to the battlefield.

147
10:23.120 --> 10:24.840
I still remember how hard it was

148
10:24.840 --> 10:25.870
just to draw it.

149
10:27.200 --> 10:29.080
Then what is this red silk for?

150
10:32.960 --> 10:33.960
A betrothal gift.

151
10:34.010 --> 10:34.870
A betrothal gift?

152
10:34.870 --> 10:35.680
General,

153
10:35.790 --> 10:37.510
you are marrying a princess.

154
10:37.510 --> 10:38.790
She spends all her days inside the palace,

155
10:38.790 --> 10:40.510
and never even leaves her room.

156
10:40.510 --> 10:41.790
How could she understand any of this?

157
10:41.790 --> 10:42.870
Yes, General.

158
10:42.870 --> 10:44.730
Can that princess even draw a bow?

159
10:48.800 --> 10:49.720
She can.

160
10:52.630 --> 10:53.550
Fire!

161
10:53.720 --> 10:55.630
The Princess has fled with her guard.

162
10:55.630 --> 10:57.740
The Emperor has ordered her captured.

163
10:57.740 --> 10:59.020
Dead or alive!

164
10:59.390 --> 11:00.200
Understood!

165
11:00.670 --> 11:01.270
Hyah!

166
11:05.150 --> 11:05.960
Hyah!

167
11:13.390 --> 11:14.600
Hyah!

168
11:21.030 --> 11:23.270
I followed the trail of your escape.

169
11:24.200 --> 11:26.150
I didn't know what I wanted.

170
11:27.440 --> 11:29.170
I only knew that at that moment,

171
11:30.240 --> 11:31.550
I wanted to see you.

172
11:38.510 --> 11:39.600
No.

173
11:51.060 --> 11:52.920
That was the first time you saw me.

174
11:54.480 --> 11:56.530
But I never dared let you know

175
11:57.010 --> 11:58.090
who I was.

176
12:04.490 --> 12:07.450
♪ Love is stained with a touch of quiet sorrow ♪

177
12:07.480 --> 12:09.870
♪ Under a crescent moon ♪

178
12:10.570 --> 12:15.690
♪ Brewing a glass of bitter cold wine ♪

179
12:12.870 --> 12:13.910
Why?

180
12:16.830 --> 12:22.630
♪ Sighing over late autumn's endless sorrows ♪

181
12:17.440 --> 12:21.600
Why? Why?

182
12:22.910 --> 12:27.880
♪ I long for the wild geese flying south ♪

183
12:28.730 --> 12:34.390
♪ Who'll bring a letter from the clouds ♪

184
12:34.410 --> 12:36.230
♪ People scatter and part ♪

185
12:36.580 --> 12:41.060
♪ A tender dream left stranded ♪

186
12:38.600 --> 12:40.240
You are General Yu.

187
12:40.720 --> 12:41.720
It all started

188
12:41.300 --> 12:44.060
♪ Heartbroken in loneliness ♪

189
12:41.760 --> 12:43.830
because of him.

190
12:44.240 --> 12:46.810
♪ So little joy remains ♪

191
12:44.720 --> 12:46.910
If it weren't for his ridiculous proposal,

192
12:46.910 --> 12:47.960
you and Ning Changyue would never have suffered

193
12:46.990 --> 12:53.060
♪ Even speaking of it is too painful ♪

194
12:47.960 --> 12:49.120
for these 3,000 painful years.

195
12:49.120 --> 12:50.920
He's the one who ruined you both!

196
12:53.480 --> 12:54.440
No.

197
12:53.590 --> 12:56.190
♪ Speaking of hope ♪

198
12:56.480 --> 12:59.060
♪ The song ends as mist and smoke clear ♪

199
12:56.870 --> 12:57.840
I love her.

200
12:59.080 --> 13:05.350
♪ Laughter can never ease the pain of parting ♪

201
13:00.030 --> 13:01.440
I do love her.

202
13:05.900 --> 13:11.710
♪ A misty rain, forever unpaid ♪

203
13:08.630 --> 13:09.910
Why?

204
13:10.080 --> 13:11.320
The Emperor has ordered

205
13:11.320 --> 13:12.670
her killed on sight.

206
13:12.070 --> 13:18.510
♪ Who pities me, with only my shadow for company? ♪

207
13:23.390 --> 13:25.120
Kill her on sight?

208
13:25.600 --> 13:27.720
What a ruthless order.

209
13:36.200 --> 13:37.320
This is treason!

210
13:37.340 --> 13:39.490
General Yu has rebelled!

211
13:50.910 --> 13:53.310
Protect the Emperor! Protect the Emperor!

212
14:12.390 --> 14:14.480
Kill! Kill! Kill him!

213
14:14.480 --> 14:15.960
Kill him for me!

214
14:48.630 --> 14:49.480
General Yu,

215
14:50.000 --> 14:50.550
I...

216
14:51.160 --> 14:52.400
will make you a king,

217
14:53.000 --> 14:54.840
and share this world with you.

218
14:56.250 --> 14:56.720
No, no.

219
14:57.030 --> 14:57.840
I'll give it all to you.

220
14:57.840 --> 14:59.300
I'll give you everything.

221
14:59.690 --> 15:00.780
Spare me!

222
15:01.240 --> 15:03.630
Please spare me!

223
15:21.300 --> 15:22.770
I should atone for my sins.

224
15:24.520 --> 15:26.710
So I killed the Emperor.

225
15:31.120 --> 15:33.120
I heard many people cheering,

226
15:34.790 --> 15:37.200
because he was never a good ruler.

227
15:39.120 --> 15:41.240
I also heard many people crying,

228
15:42.940 --> 15:44.640
because a palace coup often means...

229
15:44.640 --> 15:46.240
countless deaths.

230
15:47.790 --> 15:49.920
Fortunately, you were not among them.

231
15:52.750 --> 15:54.120
Oh, Heavens.

232
15:56.120 --> 15:59.180
If there is a next life, let me see her just one more time.

233
16:00.160 --> 16:01.440
By then,

234
16:02.220 --> 16:04.930
we will no longer be a general and a princess.

235
16:06.550 --> 16:08.630
I only wish I could simply be myself,

236
16:09.430 --> 16:11.270
and she could simply be herself.

237
16:12.490 --> 16:14.550
May we meet again as ordinary people,

238
16:15.400 --> 16:17.240
and let me give her

239
16:17.750 --> 16:20.180
happiness without any constraints.

240
16:21.240 --> 16:23.150
Even if it's just for a moment,

241
16:24.060 --> 16:25.660
it would be more than enough.

242
16:41.140 --> 16:43.910
♪ A flickering tenderness ♪

243
16:44.090 --> 16:47.050
♪ Follows where your gaze rests ♪

244
16:47.720 --> 16:50.550
♪ In this vast universe ♪

245
16:50.700 --> 16:53.060
♪ Guarding quietly from afar ♪

246
16:55.100 --> 16:57.550
♪ Love is hidden in the night sky ♪

247
16:58.080 --> 17:01.060
♪ Behind every star ♪

248
17:01.590 --> 17:03.560
♪ A dream so insignificant ♪

249
17:03.580 --> 17:06.410
♪ Yet so fiercely firm ♪

250
17:08.980 --> 17:12.380
♪ That beam of light pierced through time and space ♪

251
17:12.420 --> 17:15.760
♪ Longing rushes in across the light-years ♪

252
17:16.020 --> 17:21.660
♪ For you, I do not fear losing control while falling ♪

253
17:22.020 --> 17:24.760
♪ Before the night departs ♪

254
17:25.599 --> 17:28.250
♪ Even if I burn out ♪

255
17:28.990 --> 17:31.010
♪ I'll let the fragments behind me ♪

256
17:31.030 --> 17:35.810
♪ Fulfill all your wishes ♪

257
17:35.910 --> 17:39.080
♪ Leaving a ray of light ♪

258
17:39.460 --> 17:42.660
♪ Dreaming of brushing past you again ♪

259
17:42.770 --> 17:44.770
♪ With one last glance ♪

260
17:44.890 --> 17:47.900
♪ All I want is your smile ♪

261
17:51.350 --> 17:52.400
Song Yiqiu.

262
17:53.510 --> 17:54.590
Did you see that?

263
17:55.480 --> 17:57.750
This is the affection you thought he had,

264
17:57.960 --> 18:01.350
but it's just a karmic debt he's been repaying over countless lifetimes.

265
18:01.350 --> 18:02.680
It's because of this man

266
18:02.750 --> 18:04.920
that you and Ning Changyue ended up like this.

267
18:04.920 --> 18:06.320
-No. -He deserves to die.

268
18:06.440 --> 18:08.460
Once he is dead, no one will ruin your relationship again,

269
18:08.460 --> 18:10.860
and my sister's sacrifice won't be in vain!

270
18:12.920 --> 18:14.310
Your sister?

271
18:16.590 --> 18:17.980
Who exactly are you?

272
18:20.080 --> 18:23.080
Do you think these thousands of years of borrowed time

273
18:23.510 --> 18:25.350
were a blessing from Heaven?

274
18:27.550 --> 18:29.350
The so-called immortality pill

275
18:30.480 --> 18:32.590
is actually my sister's tree core.

276
18:33.240 --> 18:34.680
Our osmanthus trees

277
18:35.400 --> 18:36.740
cultivate for a lifetime

278
18:36.740 --> 18:38.750
to produce only one pair of tree cores.

279
18:38.750 --> 18:39.680
And the tree core

280
18:40.790 --> 18:42.310
can grant eternal life

281
18:43.090 --> 18:44.600
to true lovers.

282
18:46.110 --> 18:47.240
But the Tree Spirit,

283
18:47.920 --> 18:49.550
after losing the tree core,

284
18:50.720 --> 18:52.580
will lose all the spiritual power

285
18:53.030 --> 18:54.440
and return to nature.

286
18:58.070 --> 18:59.400
Your immortality

287
19:00.240 --> 19:02.310
was bought with my sister's life.

288
19:03.380 --> 19:04.500
She gave you a chance

289
19:04.500 --> 19:05.960
to be together forever.

290
19:05.960 --> 19:07.160
And what about you?

291
19:07.830 --> 19:10.350
You don't know how to cherish it.

292
19:13.440 --> 19:14.640
I'm sorry.

293
19:14.960 --> 19:16.480
I don't need your apology.

294
19:17.240 --> 19:18.590
I just want to kill him!

295
19:18.880 --> 19:19.920
No!

296
19:21.280 --> 19:21.830
No!

297
19:21.860 --> 19:22.550
Xie He!

298
19:51.750 --> 19:52.640
He!
